{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/d2a3a575e1a436af52d806f384f0e8cc.webp?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the might of the gods! Link the cards and weave blood passages with the roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To maintain your existence, you must constantly consume fresh blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make those creatures our sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find them! Devour them! Kill them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/a79f8bdf733ab1f55e7abbdb258e006f.poster.avif?t=1754773818\" width=592 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/a79f8bdf733ab1f55e7abbdb258e006f.webm?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/a79f8bdf733ab1f55e7abbdb258e006f.mp4?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/24997d00bf6ac19266be0af5e6103ead.webp?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concealed in mystery, the offerings of the Gods ignite an insatiable thirst within us for the blood and power they contain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the location to open the card pack with caution,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the &quot;surprises&quot; within remain unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4f795cbfb7f7cc9b12eb7aa3cc86b3f8.poster.avif?t=1754773818\" width=592 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4f795cbfb7f7cc9b12eb7aa3cc86b3f8.webm?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4f795cbfb7f7cc9b12eb7aa3cc86b3f8.mp4?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/5b18b24bed51412f30ba174448267670.webp?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximize your returns by tactically placing the organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically plan the use of each card to forge a path towards godhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/a0c12d3faa8a732eff68ade60697cf19.poster.avif?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/a0c12d3faa8a732eff68ade60697cf19.webm?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/a0c12d3faa8a732eff68ade60697cf19.mp4?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/4af33dc9a35e4c9ae638ca0c4202d5ce.webp?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They sever the roots, they proliferate without end, they\u2026 summon forth the Great Old Ones! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The existence of the hidden tribes of other intelligent creatures reminds us that we are not alone in this forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/24bdd16d9a5085ba21275ee7decb879d.poster.avif?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/24bdd16d9a5085ba21275ee7decb879d.webm?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/24bdd16d9a5085ba21275ee7decb879d.mp4?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/202f732e95d157369eb997ca25b72056.webp?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone among them might have chanced upon the mystery of the world\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you wish to be the mastermind behind the scenes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or the revered faith of ignorant human beings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/ba0b3b7cbdca3b11921e31484a1731ce.poster.avif?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/ba0b3b7cbdca3b11921e31484a1731ce.webm?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/ba0b3b7cbdca3b11921e31484a1731ce.mp4?t=1754773818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/5ff5517207a39fbdfd8097d4450ebf8c.webp?t=1754773818\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play an Elder God in this eerie and Lovecraftian forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revise your tactics and manage your blood production line while gathering vast amounts of fresh blood. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock diverse talents and mutations, construct your network of roots, and embrace new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend as the God in the faith of humans, delve into their stories, and decide whether to intervene. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a forest exploration with roguelike experiences upon each new start.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2612690?t=1754773818","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754773818","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754773818","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754773818","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3435860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US!!</h1><p><u